# Canned Spicy Tuna Roll

Based on [https://makemysushi.com/Recipes/…](https://makemysushi.com/Recipes/canned-spicy-tuna-sushi-roll-twist) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250911092805/https://makemysushi.com/Recipes/canned-spicy-tuna-sushi-roll-twist))

{ rating="3" image="canned_spicy_tuna_roll.jpg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1 Tbsp [mayo]{ ing="mayo" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [Chili sauce]{ ing="chili-sauce" } (Sriracha)
- [ ] 1 tsp [toasted sesame oil]{ ing="toasted-sesame-oil" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" } (optional)
- [ ] [spoon of masago]{ ing="spoon-of-masago" } (fish roe) (optional)
- [ ] a [bit of soy sauce]{ ing="bit-of-soy-sauce" } (optional)
- [ ] can [tuna]{ ing="tuna" }
- [ ] [sesame seeds]{ ing="sesame-seeds" }
- [ ] [cucumber]{ ing="cucumber" } (cut into quarters, remove wet seeds, cut into thirds)
- [ ] 2 [green onions]{ ing="green-onions" }, cut into thin rounds for topping
- [ ] [sushi rice]{ ing="sushi-rice" }
- [ ] [nori]{ ing="nori" }

## Recipe

1. Mix the [sauce]{ ing="chili-sauce" }, then add and mix with the canned [tuna]{ ing="tuna" }
1. Cut the [Nori]{ ing="nori" } sheet in half. Spread [rice]{ ing="sushi-rice" } over the nori and top with [sesame seeds]{ ing="sesame-seeds" }, then flip rice side down
1. Add the spicy tuna and [cucumber]{ ing="cucumber" } and roll
1. Top with a dab of spicy [mayo]{ ing="mayo" } and [green onion]{ ing="green-onions" } round
